The [[Maneki-neko]] is a legendary [[accessory]] available in the shop for all classes. It slightly increases the chance of a sale in the shop, although this is minor compared the effects which it can provide if enough value of items are touching it. With >20 {{icon/gold}} or more of items, the player has a 15% chance to resist critical hits, and with >40 {{icon/gold}}, all godly or unique items are sped up by 15%. This speed boost can massively enhance a late-game high value board.

Another important property of the [[Maneki-neko]] is that it catalytically "opens" the [[Box of Riches]] into the [[Box of Prosperity]], most importantly granting 4 backpack slots (could be considered 6, if one considers the slots no longer taken up by the [[Box of Riches]] as freed up).

The only craft which consumes the [[Maneki-neko]] is the [[Gold Armor]] which can be made by combining the [[Maneki-neko]] with [[Holy Armor]].
